{"seq":1,"slug":"degree","title":"节点的度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts/degree","wordCount":1308,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"节点的度\">节点的度</h1><p>度（degree）是最基本的网络度量：一个节点直接相连的连边数。它看似简单，却撑起了三件大事——衡量个体的连接广度、揭示有向关系中的角色不对称、并通过&quot;度分布&quot;暴露真实网络极端不均匀的&quot;无标度&quot;本性。本节从定义讲到度分布的幂律，以及由此引出的&quot;友谊悖论&quot;这一反直觉结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>度是描述单个节点连接广度的最基本度量，本节术语先固定如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 直接相连的边数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>指向该节点的边数，反映声望/受关注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>由该节点发出的边数，反映主动性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全网节点度的概率分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无标度网络</td>\n<td>度分布服从幂律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)\\sim k^{-\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，无典型&quot;平均&quot;节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>友谊悖论</td>\n<td>邻居平均度系统性高于节点平均度，是度方差的数学必然</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"度-入度与出度\">度、入度与出度</h2><p>节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是与其相连的边数。在朋友网中它是朋友数，在合作网中它是合作者数。有向网络中度分裂为两个方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>社会含义</th>\n<th>邻接矩阵</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>相连边数</td>\n<td>连接广度</td>\n<td>第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行（或列）之和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>指向该节点的边</td>\n<td>受关注、声望</td>\n<td>第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 列之和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>由该节点发出的边</td>\n<td>主动联系</td>\n<td>第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行之和</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>入度与出度的差异意味深长。在关注型网络中，入度（粉丝数）远高于出度的节点是&quot;意见领袖&quot;；这与拉扎斯菲尔德与卡茨 1955 年《Personal Influence》提出的&quot;两级传播&quot;假说相呼应——信息先到意见领袖再扩散。度本身就是最简单的中心性度量，即<a href=\"../centrality/degree-centrality\">度中心性</a>的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度分布与无标度网络\">度分布与无标度网络</h2><p>把全网所有节点的度统计成分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，就得到&quot;度分布&quot;。20 世纪曾默认网络度分布近似泊松/正态（如埃尔德什-雷尼随机图，多数节点度接近均值）。但 1999 年阿尔伯特-拉斯洛·巴拉巴西（Albert-László Barabási）与雷卡·阿尔伯特（Réka Albert）在《Science》上发表《Emergence of Scaling in Random Networks》，揭示万维网、引用网、蛋白质网等真实网络的度分布服从幂律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)\\sim k^{-\\gamma},\\quad \\gamma\\approx 2\\text{–}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0158em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>幂律的特征是&quot;无标度&quot;（scale-free）：绝大多数节点度极低，而极少数&quot;枢纽&quot;（hub）度极高，没有典型的&quot;平均&quot;节点。巴拉巴西-阿尔伯特模型用两条规则解释其成因——&quot;增长&quot;（节点不断加入）+&quot;优先连接&quot;（新节点以正比于已有度的概率连接，即&quot;富者愈富&quot;），数值与解析结果给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[度分布 P k] --&gt; B[泊松分布: 随机图]&#10;  A --&gt; C[幂律分布: 真实网络]&#10;  B --&gt; D[多数节点度接近均值]&#10;  C --&gt; E[多数节点度极低]&#10;  C --&gt; F[极少数枢纽度极高]&#10;  F --&gt; G[优先连接: 富者愈富]\">graph TD\n  A[度分布 P k] --&gt; B[泊松分布: 随机图]\n  A --&gt; C[幂律分布: 真实网络]\n  B --&gt; D[多数节点度接近均值]\n  C --&gt; E[多数节点度极低]\n  C --&gt; F[极少数枢纽度极高]\n  F --&gt; G[优先连接: 富者愈富]</pre><p>无标度结构的成因与意义详见<a href=\"../centrality/eigenvector-and-power\">特征向量中心性与权力</a>与<a href=\"../dynamics-and-significance/network-evolution\">网络演化</a>；其数学一般化见<a href=\"../../../systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/scale-free\">网络科学·无标度网络</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"友谊悖论-你的朋友比你朋友多\">友谊悖论：你的朋友比你朋友多</h2><p>度分布的不均匀带来一个反直觉结论——&quot;友谊悖论&quot;（friendship paradox），由社会学家斯科特·费尔德（Scott Feld）1991 年在《美国社会学杂志》提出：&quot;你的朋友平均而言比你有更多朋友。&quot;原因纯属采样偏差：度高的人作为&quot;别人的朋友&quot;被更频繁地计入，因此&quot;朋友的平均度&quot;系统性高于&quot;节点的平均度&quot;。</p>\n<p>这不是心理错觉而是数学必然：邻居度均值 ≥ 节点度均值，差值正比于度分布的方差。该悖论有实用价值——克里斯塔基斯（Christakis）等 2010 年提出&quot;传感器策略&quot;：与其监测随机个体，不如监测&quot;随机个体的朋友&quot;（其度更高、更靠近网络中心），能提前约两周预警流感暴发，详见<a href=\"../dynamics-and-significance/diffusion\">扩散</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>友谊悖论</td>\n<td>高度节点被更多人当朋友</td>\n<td>用&quot;朋友&quot;做疾病预警哨兵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样偏差</td>\n<td>边采样偏向高度节点</td>\n<td>解释为何&quot;别人朋友更多&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[随机采样个体] --&gt; B[平均度较低]&#10;  C[采样个体的朋友] --&gt; D[平均度更高/更中心]&#10;  D --&gt; E[更早接触传播]&#10;  E --&gt; F[流感预警提前 ~2 周]\">flowchart LR\n  A[随机采样个体] --&gt; B[平均度较低]\n  C[采样个体的朋友] --&gt; D[平均度更高/更中心]\n  D --&gt; E[更早接触传播]\n  E --&gt; F[流感预警提前 ~2 周]</pre><h2 id=\"权衡与反模式\">权衡与反模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>反模式：仅凭度判断重要性。</strong> 度只看局部直接联系；一个度低却扼守唯一桥梁的节点可能远比度高者关键——这正是<a href=\"../centrality/betweenness-closeness\">中介与接近中心性</a>要纠正的局限。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式：跨规模比绝对度。</strong> 不同规模网络的度不可直接比较，需归一化（除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡：加权度（strength）。</strong> 加权网络中&quot;度&quot;应区分边数与边权之和，二者在强弱关系混合时含义不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>度是节点直接相连的边数，衡量连接广度；有向网络分入度（声望）与出度（主动），对应两级传播中的意见领袖。</li>\n<li>度分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 揭示网络宏观结构：真实网络多服从幂律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)\\sim k^{-\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（无标度），由巴拉巴西-阿尔伯特 1999 年发现，成因是增长+优先连接。</li>\n<li>费尔德 1991 年&quot;友谊悖论&quot;是度方差的数学必然，被用于流感哨兵监测，可提前约两周预警。</li>\n<li>度只反映局部，判断重要性需配合其他中心性；下一节进入<a href=\"distance-and-paths\">距离与路径</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"节点的度","id":"节点的度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"度、入度与出度","id":"度-入度与出度"},{"level":2,"text":"度分布与无标度网络","id":"度分布与无标度网络"},{"level":2,"text":"友谊悖论：你的朋友比你朋友多","id":"友谊悖论-你的朋友比你朋友多"},{"level":2,"text":"权衡与反模式","id":"权衡与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图与矩阵的表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/foundations/representation"},"next":{"title":"距离与路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts/distance-and-paths"}}